#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:6 319f8a5fcdbf4eeab195407cded48e74
msgid "Daiwa Winch"
msgstr "Daiwa 绞车"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:11
#: f99d168f43e546a5b4cbfcb089f016d1
msgid ""
"The `Daiwa winch <http://www.ele.okaya.co.jp/index_en.html>`__ is a high "
"quality winch specially designed for drone delivery.  The winch includes a "
"\"thread end detector switch\" that protects against pulling the line in too"
" tightly and thus straining the device or breaking the thread.  The gripper "
"includes a spring mechanism that automatically releases the package when it "
"touches the ground."
msgstr ""
"`Daiwa 绞车 <http://www.ele.okaya.co.jp/index_en.html>`__ "
"是专为无人机配送设计的高品质绞车。绞车配备「线端检测开关」，可防止线缆收得过紧而损坏设备或断线。夹持器内置弹簧机构，当货物触地时可自动释放。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:13
#: 60022a0c23f246dfa8977b71c9d47e22
msgid "Weight: 630g"
msgstr "重量：630g"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:14
#: 8026ade80bfb432ab1b1e6f4cf308e82
msgid "Size: W:110mm H:82mm D:72mm"
msgstr "尺寸：宽 110mm 高 82mm 深 72mm"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:15
#: 650edf57721240cdb1bd03d132998d54
msgid "Maximum Payload: 8kg"
msgstr "最大载荷：8kg"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:16
#: e186c4b78bf842a5ae3f9a95ffe661e0
msgid "Maximum Power: 55W"
msgstr "最大功率：55W"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:17
#: 263c3fe687144ca7a69df2a5f3e119e8
msgid "Input Voltage: 7.2V ~ 22.2V"
msgstr "输入电压：7.2V ～ 22.2V"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:18
#: 03e451f39764426a840a33301adb0a43
msgid "Interface: 4xPWM or UART"
msgstr "接口：4xPWM 或 UART"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:19
#: 7dd79bcc4061464eb20aab27809f674e
msgid "Designed and manufactured in Japan"
msgstr "日本设计制造"

