msgid ""
"These winches are manufactured by Okaya (`japanese site "
"<https://www.okaya.co.jp/>`__, `english site "
"<https://www.okaya.co.jp/en/index.html>`__) and can be purchased `here "
"(English) <http://www.ele.okaya.co.jp/index_en.html>`__ or `here (Japanese) "
"<https://www.ipros.jp/product/detail/2000434011/>`__."
msgstr ""
"这些绞车由 Okaya（`日文官网 <https://www.okaya.co.jp/>`__，`英文官网 "
"<https://www.okaya.co.jp/en/index.html>`__）生产，可在 "
"`此处（英文）<http://www.ele.okaya.co.jp/index_en.html>`__ 或 "
