#: 3fcdd69d54154ef480d74382b8e0c9f3
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:30
#: 0b3a9de57910433b820c97fda12c0efa
msgid "Connect the winch to the autopilot as shown below"
msgstr "按下图将绞车连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:36
#: 431b8ac110674c9291810abb3bf6d094
msgid ""
"Connect the 3-pin Winch Control wire (red cable tie) to AUX OUT 1 (aka "
"Servo9)"
msgstr "将 3 针绞车控制线（红色扎带）连接到 AUX OUT 1（即 Servo9）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:37
#: 1f22ab5b904241c0a0e8d2c2c2601be8
msgid ""
"Connect the 3-pin Winch Clutch wire (yellow cable tie) to AUX OUT 2 (aka "
"Servo10)"
msgstr "将 3 针绞车离合线（黄色扎带）连接到 AUX OUT 2（即 Servo10）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:38
#: 06a0aa86c25049c0a9805bd025b56372
msgid ""
"Connect the 3-pin Winch Zero Reset wire (blue cable tie) to AUX OUT 3 (aka "
"Servo11)"
msgstr "将 3 针绞车归零复位线（蓝色扎带）连接到 AUX OUT 3（即 Servo11）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:39
#: 1bbfc7fad043468192c0ab20e4077dbd
msgid ""
"Connect the 3-pin Winch Telemetry wire (blue cable tie) to the Autopilot's "
"Telem2 (or any other telemetry port)"
msgstr "将 3 针绞车数传线（蓝色扎带）连接到飞控的 Telem2（或任意其他数传端口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:40
#: e35c3b426a874e8bbebec7fdcc39213e
msgid ""
"The Zero Reset (green cable tie) used to calibrate the winch should be left "
"disconnected"
msgstr "用于校准绞车的归零复位线（绿色扎带）应保持断开"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:41
#: 982804bf03874c7cbff3908707a1aec2
msgid "A 7.2V to 22.2V power supply is required to power the motors"
msgstr "需要 7.2V 至 22.2V 电源为电机供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:42
#: 71fa6c3706314600bba0eb4b9806e3e6
msgid ""
"A 5V BEC can optionally be connected to the autopilot's servo rail to "
"provide power to the winch electronics.  This is not required if the "
"Telemetry wire is connected"
msgstr "可选择将 5V BEC 连接到飞控舵机轨道，为绞车电子设备供电。如已连接数传线，则无需此步骤"

