"most boards. Note that this does not necessarily correspond to UART2 on some"
" boards."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 31（绞车）。注意：此处假设绞车数传连接到 "
"SERIAL2，通常为大多数板卡的 TELEM2。注意这在某些板卡上不一定对应 UART2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:60
#: 7fc17536df0d47838241f3559f6e7c93
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 38 (38400 baud) or 115 (115200 baud), "
"depending on version of winch."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 38（38400 波特）或 115（115200 波特），取决于绞车版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:61
#: 4380eefbd5a241afb0be45ffd0c06e54
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 45 (Winch Control) to allow controlling the"
" winch speed from the transmitter's channel 6 knob"
msgstr ":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 45（绞车控制），允许通过发射机通道 6 旋钮控制绞车速度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:62
#: 0a61ae078e0f4c238f3f08211290b80f
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_DZ <RC6_DZ>` = 30.  This deadzone is used to detect whether the "
"pilot has moved the winch control knob to retake control from autonomous "
"operation"
msgstr ":ref:`RC6_DZ <RC6_DZ>` = 30。此死区用于检测飞手是否移动了绞车控制旋钮以从自动操作中重新接管控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:63
#: b12af5e0c98b4cd1b01631210e59609d
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_TRIM <RC6_TRIM>` = The mid value between :ref:`RC6_MIN <RC6_MIN>` "
"and :ref:`RC6_MAX <RC6_MAX>` which is normally close to 1500"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC6_TRIM <RC6_TRIM>` = :ref:`RC6_MIN <RC6_MIN>` 和 :ref:`RC6_MAX "
"<RC6_MAX>` 之间的中间值，通常接近 1500"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:64
#: 91329aee4b17488e90359864f4a39952
msgid ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 44 (Winch Enable) to allow relaxing the "
"winch by pulling the transmitter's channel 8 switch low"
msgstr ":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 44（绞车启用），允许通过将发射机通道 8 开关拨至低位来放松绞车"

