#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:84
#: 59cfe60bb7ba4587939a3528d72128ca
msgid ""
"The status of the winch can be viewed in real-time using Mission Planner or "
"QGC's MAVLink Inspector window.  If using Mission Planner push the \"MAVLink"
" Inspector\" button found under Setup, Advanced."
msgstr ""
"可使用 Mission Planner 或 QGC 的 MAVLink 检查器窗口实时查看绞车状态。使用 Mission Planner "
