#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:90
#: fd0cd421462e49368649dc21b9060fe9
msgid ""
"The winch's current draw, length of line, current speed (in m/s) temperature"
" and voltage can all be seen."
msgstr "可查看绞车的电流、线缆长度、当前速度（m/s）、温度和电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:93
#: ae112b18fe584906846dce9158a89d8f
msgid "Zero Reset Line Length"
msgstr "归零复位线缆长度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:95
#: 14948473df664d46a7948a7c59520a2d
msgid ""
"The winch constantly estimates how much line has been deployed and will stop"
" retracting line once this estimated line length has reached zero in order "
"to protect the line from being broken.  This estimate is prone to drift "
"however meaning that you may find it impossible to completely retract the "
"line or (less likely) it may retract too far and break the line.  To avoid "
"these issues the line length estimate should be periodically reset to zero "
"using the following procedure:"
msgstr ""
"绞车会持续估算已放出的线缆长度，并在估算长度归零时停止收线，以防线缆断裂。但该估算容易漂移，可能导致无法完全收回线缆，或（较少见地）收得过度而断线。为避免这些问题，应定期按以下步骤将线缆长度估算重置为零："

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:97
#: fb03efc43a0949198ab09ab60fb8f791
msgid "Power on the autopilot and winch"
msgstr "给飞控和绞车上电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:98
#: 86f5b458506c46c78c258a0b48be41db
msgid ""
"Connect with Mission Planner, open the Setup, Advanced screen and push the "
"\"MAVLink Inspector\" button and check the current line length."
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 连接，打开「设置→高级」界面，点击「MAVLink 检查器」按钮并查看当前线缆长度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:99
#: c7abce1fda8c45cebe0b5b16fd800f21
msgid ""
"Retract the line (perhaps using the RC6 tuning knob) to within 20cm or so of"
" the ideal minimum length"
msgstr "收回线缆（可使用 RC6 调节旋钮）至接近理想最短长度 20cm 左右"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:100
#: 05e1d292892b44a1931c0609a6152e76
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner's Data, Servo/Relay tab, find the row for output 11"
msgstr "打开 Mission Planner 的「数据→舵机/继电器」标签页，找到输出 11 对应的行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:101
#: c381aba1084e4021973d1a3015eb748c
msgid ""
"Push the \"High\" button to simultaneously retract the line and reset the "
"line length to zero"
msgstr "点击「High（高）」按钮，同时收回线缆并将线缆长度重置为零"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:102
#: bde98ad818804a1c9efaa56edb9801e9
msgid "Push the \"Low\" button to retracting the line"
msgstr "点击「Low（低）」按钮停止收线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:109
#: 6c1ba71edd3a4252b9bfe70d1550aa43
msgid "Control during Missions"
msgstr "任务中的控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:111
#: f7ecdc8b2ca442c48e378dc5e127a10f
msgid ""
"The Winch can be controlled during Autonomous missions using the DO_WINCH "
"mission command.  See the bottom of the :ref:`Copter Mission Command List "
"<copter:mission-command-list>` for more details"
msgstr ""
"可在自主任务中使用 DO_WINCH 任务命令控制绞车。详情请参阅 :ref:`Copter 任务命令列表 <copter:mission-"
"command-list>` 底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:114
#: bedd41fcb4a14ec4b5e2a965058bcec5
msgid "Winch-test Lua Script"
msgstr "绞车测试 Lua 脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:116
#: a957257748a341afbb922098b014af1a
msgid ""
"In cases where the vehicle will be well outside of RC range and no joystick "
"is being used, the `winch-test lua script "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/winch-"
"test.lua>`__ may be useful in order to allow manually raise or lower the "
"line using Mission Planner's Aux Function page."
msgstr ""
"当飞行器在 RC 遥控范围之外且未使用摇杆时，可使用 `winch-test lua 脚本 "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/winch-"
"test.lua>`__ 通过 Mission Planner 的辅助功能页面手动升降线缆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:119
#: c6dd2d8dcd0f45a0bafdc08e9748d9a9
msgid "Video"
msgstr "视频"
